{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-join-dimension","title":"流流 Join、维表关联与异步查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/flink-stream-processing/patterns/stream-join-dimension","wordCount":1810,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"流流-join-维表关联与异步查询\">流流 Join、维表关联与异步查询</h1><p>流上的 join 和数据库里的 join 有一个本质差别：数据库可以等两张表都静止下来再比较，而流永远在动，你没法等。因此流 join 的核心问题变成「<strong>为了等到对面那条记录，我愿意把这边多少数据留在状态里、留多久</strong>」。这个问题的三种答法对应三类技术：把时间窗口都有的两边按时间范围关联（interval join）、把没有时间边界的一边建成持续更新的状态（regular join）、把外部系统的查询搬进流处理（维表 lookup join）。选错的直接后果是状态无限增长直到作业崩溃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流的 join 可以按「两边的有界性」分成三类，它们的实现与代价完全不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[两条流需要关联] --&gt; B{两边是否都有时间戳&lt;br/&gt;且关联有时间边界?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[Interval Join&lt;br/&gt;状态按时间窗口自动清理]&#10;    B --&gt;|否, 一边是持续变化的维表| D{维表在外部系统?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[Lookup Join&lt;br/&gt;异步查询 + 缓存]&#10;    D --&gt;|否, 两条流都要长期记住| F[Regular Join&lt;br/&gt;状态随 key 空间增长]&#10;    F --&gt; G[必须配状态 TTL&lt;br/&gt;否则无限增长]&#10;    C --&gt; H[状态有界&lt;br/&gt;窗口过期即释放]&#10;    E --&gt; I[状态小&lt;br/&gt;只缓存查询结果]\">flowchart TD\n    A[两条流需要关联] --&gt; B{两边是否都有时间戳&lt;br/&gt;且关联有时间边界?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[Interval Join&lt;br/&gt;状态按时间窗口自动清理]\n    B --&gt;|否, 一边是持续变化的维表| D{维表在外部系统?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[Lookup Join&lt;br/&gt;异步查询 + 缓存]\n    D --&gt;|否, 两条流都要长期记住| F[Regular Join&lt;br/&gt;状态随 key 空间增长]\n    F --&gt; G[必须配状态 TTL&lt;br/&gt;否则无限增长]\n    C --&gt; H[状态有界&lt;br/&gt;窗口过期即释放]\n    E --&gt; I[状态小&lt;br/&gt;只缓存查询结果]</pre><p>三条路径的状态特征差异是选型的第一判据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Join 类型</th>\n<th>状态内容</th>\n<th>状态增长</th>\n<th>能否与无边界维表关联</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Interval Join</td>\n<td>时间窗口内的两边数据</td>\n<td>有界，随窗口释放</td>\n<td>不能</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Regular Join</td>\n<td>每个 key 的最新记录（或全部历史）</td>\n<td>随 key 空间增长</td>\n<td>能</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lookup Join</td>\n<td>查询结果缓存</td>\n<td>小且有界</td>\n<td>能（外部系统）</td>\n<td>取决于查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Temporal Join</td>\n<td>维表的历史版本</td>\n<td>随版本数增长</td>\n<td>能（需要版本化）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Regular Join 是最容易出事的一类</strong>，因为它的状态增长是隐式的。写 <code>SELECT * FROM orders JOIN users ON orders.uid = users.id</code> 时，Flink 需要为每个出现过的 <code>uid</code> 保存订单侧与用户侧的数据——如果两条流都没有时间边界，这个状态只增不减。生产环境里这个 SQL 通常需要配合 <code>table.exec.state.ttl</code> 才对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"interval-join-用时间边界约束状态\">Interval Join：用时间边界约束状态</h2><p>Interval Join 要求两边都是事件时间流，且关联条件包含一个时间范围：订单发生后 10 分钟内到达的支付记录与之关联。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"orders.keyBy(Order::getOrderId)&#10;    .intervalJoin(payments.keyBy(Payment::getOrderId))&#10;    .between(Duration.ofMinutes(-10), Duration.ofMinutes(10))&#10;    .process(new OrderPaymentJoin())&#10;    .uid(&quot;order-payment-join&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orders.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getOrderId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">intervalJoin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payments.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Payment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getOrderId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">between</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderPaymentJoin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-payment-join\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它的状态管理逻辑很清晰：对每条到的记录，Flink 保留它直到「水位线越过它的时间戳 + 时间边界」为止。因此<strong>状态大小 = 时间范围内的数据量</strong>，与 key 空间无关。这是有正确性保证的 join 里状态最可控的一种。</p>\n<p>时间边界的设定需要看业务语义，而不是越小越好：设得太小会漏掉合法的迟到关联（支付可能 15 分钟后才到），设得太大则状态占用变大。实践做法是把边界设为「该关联在业务上仍然有意义的最大时间差」与「实测到达延迟分布的 p99」两者中的较大值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"维表关联的三种实现\">维表关联的三种实现</h2><p>把外部维表（MySQL 用户表、Redis 商品表）关联进流是最常见的需求，有三种实现，代价依次递进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>数据新鲜度</th>\n<th>吞吐</th>\n<th>外部系统压力</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动时全量加载（广播状态）</td>\n<td>差，需重启更新</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lookup Join（同步查询）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>低，被查询延迟限住</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lookup Join（异步查询 + 缓存）</td>\n<td>好，取决于缓存 TTL</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维表变更流 + 广播（CDC）</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（只需订阅变更）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>同步 Lookup Join 的吞吐上限等于 <code>并行度 / 查询延迟</code></strong>。假设查询一次维表要 5ms，并行度 16，那么理论吞吐只有 3200 条/秒，且每条记录都要阻塞等待——这在高流量场景下不可接受。异步查询把等待时间重叠起来，同样的并行度可以提升一到两个数量级。<code>AsyncDataStream</code> 与维表连接器的接口在 Flink 1.13 之后趋于稳定（来源：FLIP-173 统一的维表连接器接口与 <code>AsyncDataStream</code> 文档，见 <a href=\"https://nightlies.apache.org/flink/）。\">https://nightlies.apache.org/flink/）。</a></p>\n<p>Flink 的 <code>AsyncDataStream</code> 提供了两种模式，选择取决于是否允许乱序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"DataStream&lt;Enriched&gt; enriched = AsyncDataStream&#10;    .unorderedWait(&#10;        stream,&#10;        new AsyncUserLookup(),&#10;        30, TimeUnit.SECONDS,&#10;        100)&#10;    .uid(&quot;async-lookup&quot;);&#10;&#10;public class AsyncUserLookup extends RichAsyncFunction&lt;Event, Enriched&gt; {&#10;    private transient Cache&lt;Long, User&gt; cache;&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void open(Configuration cfg) {&#10;        cache = CacheBuilder.newBuilder()&#10;            .maximumSize(100_000)&#10;            .expireAfterWrite(Duration.ofMinutes(10))&#10;            .build();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void asyncInvoke(Event e, ResultFuture&lt;Enriched&gt; future) {&#10;        User cached = cache.getIfPresent(e.getUid());&#10;        if (cached != null) {&#10;            future.complete(Collections.singletonList(join(e, cached)));&#10;            return;&#10;        }&#10;        client.getUser(e.getUid())&#10;            .thenAccept(u -&gt; {&#10;                cache.put(e.getUid(), u);&#10;                future.complete(Collections.singletonList(join(e, u)));&#10;            })&#10;            .exceptionally(t -&gt; {&#10;                future.complete(Collections.singletonList(join(e, User.EMPTY)));&#10;                return null;&#10;            });&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Enriched</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> enriched </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AsyncDataStream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unorderedWait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        stream,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AsyncUserLookup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, TimeUnit.SECONDS,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"async-lookup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AsyncUserLookup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RichAsyncFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Enriched</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> transient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Cache&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> cache;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Configuration </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cfg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cache </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CacheBuilder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">newBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maximumSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expireAfterWrite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> asyncInvoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Event </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ResultFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Enriched</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">future</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        User cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getIfPresent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            future.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Collections.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">singletonList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e, cached)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenAccept</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), u);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                future.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Collections.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">singletonList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e, u)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exceptionally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                future.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Collections.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">singletonList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e, User.EMPTY)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>unorderedWait</code> 与 <code>orderedWait</code> 的差别是<strong>是否保证输出顺序与输入一致</strong>。<code>orderedWait</code> 会给每条在途记录分配序号并在输出侧重排，代价是内存占用与延迟升高；<code>unorderedWait</code> 直接按完成顺序输出，吞吐更高。绝大多数维表关联不要求顺序，用 <code>unorderedWait</code>。</p>\n<p>三个必须处理的工程细节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>超时与降级</strong>：<code>AsyncDataStream</code> 的超时参数决定一条记录等多久后放弃。超时后必须给出一个降级结果（如空维表值），否则 <code>ResultFuture</code> 不完成会导致检查点永远做不出来——这是异步 IO 最危险的失败模式。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存容量与 TTL</strong>：<code>CacheBuilder</code> 的 <code>maximumSize</code> 决定内存上限，<code>expireAfterWrite</code> 决定维表变更多久可见。两者与状态规模估算同源，方法见 <a href=\"../fundamentals/stateful-streaming\">有状态流处理与恰好一次语义</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>在途请求上限</strong>：<code>AsyncDataStream</code> 的容量参数（上例中的 100）限制同时未完成的请求数，是保护外部系统的背压手段。设得太大可能压垮维表库；设得太小则会把外部系统的延迟直接变成作业的反压，这类「CPU 低但反压高」的形态在 <a href=\"backpressure-skew\">反压定位与数据倾斜治理</a> 中有专门讨论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"广播状态与维表-cdc\">广播状态与维表 CDC</h2><p>当维表变更需要<strong>立刻</strong>对所有流数据生效、且维表本身不大时，广播状态是最优解：把维表变更流广播给所有并行子任务，每个子任务在本地维护一份完整副本，关联时零网络开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"MapStateDescriptor&lt;Long, User&gt; userState =&#10;    new MapStateDescriptor&lt;&gt;(&quot;users&quot;, Long.class, User.class);&#10;&#10;BroadcastStream&lt;User&gt; userUpdates = userChangeStream&#10;    .broadcast(userState);&#10;&#10;DataStream&lt;Enriched&gt; result = eventStream&#10;    .connect(userUpdates)&#10;    .process(new BroadcastEnrichFunction())&#10;    .uid(&quot;broadcast-enrich&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MapStateDescriptor&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> userState </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MapStateDescriptor&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"users\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Long.class, User.class);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BroadcastStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> userUpdates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userChangeStream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Enriched</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventStream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userUpdates)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BroadcastEnrichFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"broadcast-enrich\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>广播状态的约束是<strong>每个子任务持有全量维表</strong>，因此维表大小 × 并行度 是内存下限。维表几万行时完全可行，几百万行时就要换方案。另一个约束是广播流与主流之间的处理顺序无法保证——刚变更的维表值可能对几条在途数据尚未生效，需要业务容忍这个短暂的不一致。</p>\n<p>维表规模与更新频率的组合决定了方案选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维表规模</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 10 万行</td>\n<td>分钟级或更低</td>\n<td>广播状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 10 万行</td>\n<td>高（秒级）</td>\n<td>广播 CDC 流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>百万级以上</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>异步 Lookup Join + 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>极低（天级）</td>\n<td>启动时全量加载 + 定期重载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Temporal Join 是介于两者之间的方案：它把维表的历史变更保存成带版本的状态，关联时按事件时间取「那一刻的维表版本」。语义最精确（能还原历史快照），代价是维表版本状态随变更次数增长。SQL 里的写法是用 <code>FOR SYSTEM_TIME AS OF</code> 关联一张版本化表。它适合对账、审计等要求历史精确性的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流 join 的核心约束是「为等对面记录愿意付多少状态」；三类 join 的状态增长特征完全不同。</li>\n<li>Interval Join 用时间边界把状态限制在窗口内，是有正确性保证的 join 里最可控的一种。</li>\n<li>Regular Join 的状态随 key 空间隐式增长，必须配 <code>table.exec.state.ttl</code>，否则会撑爆作业。</li>\n<li>同步 Lookup Join 的吞吐上限是「并行度 / 查询延迟」，高流量必须异步化。</li>\n<li>异步 IO 必须处理超时并给出降级结果，否则 <code>ResultFuture</code> 不完成会阻塞检查点。</li>\n<li>广播状态把维表全量复制到每个子任务，适合小维表；大维表用带缓存的异步查询。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流流 Join、维表关联与异步查询","id":"流流-join-维表关联与异步查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Interval Join：用时间边界约束状态","id":"interval-join-用时间边界约束状态"},{"level":2,"text":"维表关联的三种实现","id":"维表关联的三种实现"},{"level":2,"text":"广播状态与维表 CDC","id":"广播状态与维表-cdc"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"窗口、触发器与增量聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/flink-stream-processing/patterns/windows-triggers"},"next":{"title":"反压定位与数据倾斜治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/flink-stream-processing/patterns/backpressure-skew"}}